    {
      "name": "schedule",
      "form": "f(t)=s\\!\\left(\\frac{t-t_{open}}{\\tau_o}\\right)\\left[1-s\\!\\left(\\frac{t-t_{close}}{\\tau_c}\\right)\\right],\\ s(x)=x^2(3-2x)",
